const beforeReferralActivities=pages[8];pages[8]=function(){let h=beforeReferralActivities();if(typeof activityCategory!=='undefined'&&activityCategory==='限时活动')return h;let card=`<article class="card activity"><div class="activityart" style="background:#fff0f1;color:#df2435;font-size:36px">邀</div><div class="content"><span class="tag">常驻活动</span><h2 style="margin:12px 0">推荐新商家入驻</h2><p>推荐新人开店，按月发货成功金额享阶梯返佣</p></div>${action('查看推荐码与返佣','referralMerchantActivity()',true)}</article>`;let i=h.indexOf('<article');return i<0?h+card:h.slice(0,i)+card+h.slice(i)};render();


function recordMerchantOnline(){let id=immutableShopId,data={};try{data=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('merchantLastActiveV1')||'{}')}catch(e){}data[id]=Math.max(Number(data[id])||0,Date.now());localStorage.setItem('merchantLastActiveV1',JSON.stringify(data))}
for(let type of ['click','input','change','keydown','submit','scroll'])document.addEventListener(type,e=>{if(e.isTrusted)recordMerchantOnline()},{capture:true,passive:true});recordMerchantOnline();


function merchantReviewImages(r){return (r.images||[]).length?`<div style="display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:14px 0">${r.images.map((src,i)=>`<button style="padding:0;background:none;border:0" onclick="previewMerchantReviewImage('${r.id}',${i})"><img src="${esc(src)}" alt="评论图片${i+1}" style="width:110px;height:110px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:5px"></button>`).join('')}</div>`:''}
